MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- student build: the separate sources/file-browser column never mounts;
  Sources is the pinned first tab of the tabbed rail (Sources | Browser |
  Preview | files), close disabled on the pinned tab
- pane gates (railColumnOpen / Pane disabled / previewPaneOpen) treat the
  student rail as always-populated; titlebar right button toggles the rail
- agent-browser watcher skips the initial store snapshot so restored
  sessions don't pop the mirror on relaunch
- school-portal skill: ask once for the school's exact portal URLs, save
  via the memory tool to USER.md, never re-ask (verified E2E: elicitation
  form -> refused to memorize a fake URL -> real fact written to USER.md)
